{"id":"n15324-1-21","stage":1,"title":"무료 · 免费","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15324-1-21-1","ko":"이건 어디서 난 거야?","zh":"这是从哪儿弄来的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이건","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이건","audio":"/audio/5a674df42cc1d8ac9ff2.mp3"}},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"来，有","explanation":"나다：来，有；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"14","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"来，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现原本没有的钱财或东西。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/0281b05f93fa11acc3e0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15324-1-21-2","ko":"물건을 많이 샀더니 백화점에서 무료로 나눠 준 거야.","zh":"买了很多东西，百货商店就免费送了这个。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물건을","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건을","audio":"/audio/9f0ff175ca9f394f7144.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"샀더니","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀더니","audio":"/audio/9572f8d3d2d53290df01.mp3"}},{"text":"백화점에서","meaning":"百货商店","explanation":"백화점：百货商店；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"백화점","audio":"/audio/655eab9f02534cf0ba14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26844","senseId":"1","lemma":"백화점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"백화점에서","audio":"/audio/0025e210c446caa2fbd6.mp3"}},{"text":"무료로","meaning":"免费","explanation":"무료：免费；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"무료","audio":"/audio/b8fb53470843c312b5c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15324","senseId":"1","lemma":"무료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무료로","audio":"/audio/4e35a33d094340f432da.mp3"}},{"text":"나눠","meaning":"分配，分","explanation":"나누다：分配，分；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"4","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나눠","audio":"/audio/619955ee27d4766a3569.mp3"}},{"text":"준","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준","audio":"/audio/380bd5afbff5e69e5943.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"655eab9f02534cf0","term":"백화점","zh":"百货商店","audio":"/audio/655eab9f02534cf0ba14.mp3","entryId":"26844","definition":"在一个建筑内按照种类分区摆放和销售各种商品的大商店。","pronunciation":["배콰점"]},{"id":"b8fb53470843c312","term":"무료","zh":"免费","audio":"/audio/b8fb53470843c312b5c3.mp3","entryId":"15324","definition":"不收费用。","pronunciation":["무료"]},{"id":"8a88d2ae9895b06e","term":"나누다","zh":"分配，分","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3","entryId":"29749","definition":"分别给予各自的一份儿。","pronunciation":["나누다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/05a8ef21a6988ca7f018.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15324","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.1253,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这个准备送到哪里去？","这是从哪儿弄来的？","这个东西什么时候会到？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是我在百货商店花钱单独买的。","因为买得太少，所以商店没有送东西。","买了很多东西，百货商店就免费送了这个。"],"answer":2}]}
